  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strong roots, strong women</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The Action will strengthen capacity of women in Eco-system-based Adaptation  (EbA) for sustainable economic development in the Huong River basin. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The&lt;strong&gt; Overall objectives &lt;/strong&gt;of the action is to strengthen the role of local actors and women in climate change decisions and actions, thereby contributing to improved biodiversity of the region and resilience of the local community. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Specific Objectives (SO)/Outcome&lt;/strong&gt; of the action are as follows:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;SO1: Improve capacity of local actors, especially vulnerable communities and women, on nature-based solutions, eco-based adaptation and disaster risk management&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;SO2: Increase livelihood opportunities for women and local communities&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;SO3: Restore mangroves and wetland in the lagoon&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
